### Catching Container Exceptions

Source: https://github.com/phpstan/phpstan-src/blob/2.3.x/_autodocs/errors.md

Demonstrates how to handle MissingServiceException and ParameterNotFoundException when accessing the PHPStan container.

```php
<?php
use PHPStan\DependencyInjection\Container;
use PHPStan\DependencyInjection\MissingServiceException;
use PHPStan\DependencyInjection\ParameterNotFoundException;

/** @var Container $container */
try {
	$service = $container->getService('fileFinderAnalyse');
} catch (MissingServiceException $e) {
	// service not registered in this configuration
}

try {
	$level = $container->getParameter('level');
} catch (ParameterNotFoundException $e) {
	// parameter not registered
}
```

